      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Escuro. Houndour é inteligente o suficiente para caçar em matilhas. Ele usa diversos tipos de chamados para se comunicar com outros de sua espécie e coordenar a perseguição de suas presas.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Houndour pode evoluir para Houndoom no nível 8 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Ember, Leer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Howl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Smog</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Roar</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Incinerate, Odor Sleuth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Beat Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Fire Fang</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Feint Attack, Torment</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Comeuppance, Embargo</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Foul Play</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Crunch, Flamethrower</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Inferno, Nasty Plot</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Body Slam, Burning Jealousy, Confide, Crunch, Dark Pulse, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dream Eater, Embargo, Endure, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Fang, Fire Spin, Flame Charge, Flamethrower, Flare Blitz, Foul Play, Frustration, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Voice, Iron Tail, Lash Out, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Nasty Plot, Overheat, Pain Split, Payback, Protect, Psychic Fangs, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Reversal, Roar, Role Play, Round, Scary Face, Shadow Ball, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Snarl, Snatch, Snore, Solar Beam, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Swagger, Take Down, Taunt, Temper Flare, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Fang, Torment, Toxic, Trailblaze, Uproar, Will-O-Wisp</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Beat Up, Counter, Destiny Bond, Feint, Fire Fang, Fire Spin, Nasty Plot, Punishment, Pursuit, Rage, Reversal, Spite, Sucker Punch, Thunder Fang</p>",
